          <a href="#which-to-buy" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Which One to Buy</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Common Mistakes</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. FAQ</a>
        </nav>
