          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            EGO makes the best-rounded battery snow lineup available, but the lineup only helps if you pick the right piece of it. For most paved driveways that is the 21-inch single-stage. For plow ridges, gravel and heavy storms it is the 24-inch two-stage. The shovel and the attachment are for steps and walks.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Price the batteries as part of the machine, keep them warm, and be honest about how long your driveway and your storms really are. If the answer is very long and very deep, gas may still be the better tool; if not, an EGO will start every time and ask very little of you between storms.
          </p>
